window.products.push({"id":681024,"name":"BINGTOO Power Lift Recliner Chair with Massage and Heat, Electric Recliners for Elderly, Heated Vibration Massage Sofa Living Room Chair with USB Port","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":339.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81kO6rwNm8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【POWER LIFT RECLINER CHAIRS】Counter-balanced lift mechanism pushes the entire lift chair up to help the elderly and seniors stand up easily without adding stress to back or knees. This power lift chair is also an ideal choice for those who have difficulty standing from the chair. All you have to do is press the button. The lift chair can be smoothly adjusted to any custom position, allowing the lift to stop at any position you like, and finally helps you stand easily. 【ELECTRIC RECLINER CHAIRS】The electric recliner chairs will recline gently, could stop at any position you want, the max angle is 150 degrees. This reclining chair can work as a temporary replacement for a bed, especially for those who have difficulty lying flat. Just recline the chair, cover it with a blanket, then you could have a sound dream! Suitable for watching TV, reading, resting, napping. This recliner can make you feel very comfortable and help you get the ultimate leisure experience. 【POWER LIFT RECLINER CHAIR WITH HEAT & MASSAGE】Chair has 8 points massage, 3 times modes，The 4 areas of massage focus (leg, thigh, lumbar, back) with 5 modes( pulse, press, wave, auto, normal) meet your demand of different massage, heat function is for the lumbar part. When you feel tired, you can enjoy the massage function of the chair under zero gravity to completely relax the body. 【USB OUTLET & Side Pocket】Thoughtful and practical design—cupholder, side pockets, and USB port! Keep your drink in the cupholder, and place gadgets like books and remote control inside pockets. With the convenient USB port, charge your device freely anytime! (Note: The USB port is only suitable for low-power devices such as mobile and iPads). Side pockets for small items (your books, magazines, iPad, etc.) within reach. These additional functions will bring you a lot of convenience. 【EASY ASSEMBLY & SIZE】Recliner measures 32.3\"(W) x 29.5\"(D) x 40.9\"(H), with a 21.6\"(W) x 21.6”(D) seat. This power recliner chair comes with assembly instructions, very easy to assemble and usually only takes 10-15 minutes to finish the installation, no tools required.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81kO6rwNm8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BINGTOO","source_asin":"B0BMTRRHG4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-681024","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BMTRRHG4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BMTRRHG4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
