window.products.push({"id":681031,"name":"Wekity Toothbrush Holder Wall Mounted, Multi-Functional Toothbrush and Automatic Toothpaste Dispenser for Bathroom, with Cups, Grey Toothbrush Holder ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51kBXw0M6NL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"WEKITY Multi-functional Wall-mounted Toothpaste and Toothbrush Holder WEKITY Toothpaste Dispenser and Toothpaste Squeezer Kit are made from Environment-friendly silicone, harmless to toothpaste tube.  Easy to install the dispenser and the holder on our wall.  Non-nail design won't damage the wall.  Hygienic &Economy - Pump every drop toothpaste in tube Keeps everything nice and neat. Package Include: 1x Toothbrush Holder with 1 cup or 2 cups  1x Toothpaste Dispenser 1x Adhesive Strip (The toothbrushes, toothpaste and other items on toothbrush holder are not included) Very Important: Always make sure the toothpaste is tightly screwed into the toothpaste squeezer inlet.  Only it's seal connected, it will work very well.  Please push the rod of toothpaste dispenser for 3-5 times to squeeze the air out for the first time to use. NO NEED TO PUNCH HOLES The product is attached with no trace stickers, suction wall type suspension, protect the wall without leaving traces, save your Bathroom space. Steps of installation: Clean the wall and make the surface dry.  Tearing off the super indentation glue film.  Installation of super indentation.  Press the film Install the assembled object onto the adhesive without sticking. Once it sticks to the surface, it will not fall off easily. Note: Applicable wall: smooth tile, wooden wall, smooth marble, smooth glass, frosted glass, smooth metal. Not applicable wall: wallpaper, lime wall, paint wall.  If the toothbrush holder fall off due to incorrect installation, please contact us and we will send you a new seamless adhesive.  Hope you can enjoy the convenience it brings to you by the multifunctional wall-mounted toothbrush holder. Any problem pls feel free to contact us. We promise 12-hour Response Time for Customer Issues","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51kBXw0M6NL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Wekity","source_asin":"B08DR3ZLVX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-681031","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08DR3ZLVX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08DR3ZLVX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
