window.products.push({"id":681157,"name":"Roho Prodigy Premium Mattress Overlay, Voted #1 Non-Powered overlay. Exclusive dry-flotation technology. Exceeds alternating pressure overlay performa","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":297.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51D7rLKtiaL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"SUPERIOR PERFORMANCE vs alternating pressure pad overlays. With an industry leading depth-of-immersion of 3.5 inches, the Prodigy will NEVER BOTTOM OUT – the MOST critical factor in pressure sore prevention, pain management and wound healing. Alternating pressure pads typically only provide a 1.5” depth-of-immersion which results in “bottoming out”- rendering them virtually useless. This is the main reason hospitals and nursing homes NEVER USE BUDGET-PRICED ALTERNATING PRESSURE PAD OVERLAYS. 3-IN-1 FUNCTIONALITY WITH ZONED SETTINGS- The Prodigy provides professional-grade Pressure Sore Prevention, Wound Healing AND Pain Relief-all in 1 product. With 3 zones that can be customized based on the users needs, the Prodigy can be set up for OPTIMIZED comfort and healing. Head/Upper body section, Hips/Coccyx section and Leg/Foot section can all be independently set to different pressures vs. alternating pressure pads that only allow for the same pressure throughout the entire surface. ZERO MAINTENANCE. No moving parts. No air filters to replace. No noise. No heat generation. No electricity consumption. No cords or hoses to trip over. Alternating pressure pad overlays are notorious for numerous ongoing service issues, costly replacement parts, tripping hazards, unwanted heat and noise generation and bottoming out- ALL of which are non-issues with the Prodigy. THE #1 NAME IN PRESSURE RELIEF for over 45 years. More doctors, nurses and other healthcare professionals recommended ROHO surfaces for pressure relief than any other brand. It’s no wonder that, on average, every day, there are OVER 1 MILLION USERS around the world counting on ROHO to protect their health and make their lives better. MADE IN THE USA, Stocked in the USA and Serviced from the USA as opposed to virtually all alternating pressure pads that are Made in China. Your loved one deserves comfort, compassion, healing and pain relief in their time of need, can you afford to provide them with anything less than the very best? ***IMPORTANT- PLEASE BE CERTAIN TO CAREFULLY REVIEW PRODUCT DIMENSIONS PRIOR TO ORDERING THIS ITEM TO MAKE SURE IT WILL PROPERLY FIT THE INTENDED USER AND THE INTENDED ENVIRONMENT.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51D7rLKtiaL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Platinum Health","source_asin":"B000LX1HZI","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-681157","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000LX1HZI","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000LX1HZI","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
