window.products.push({"id":681197,"name":"Wanqueen 8 Pack Mouse Repellent Mice Repellent, Peppermint Oil to Repel Mice and Rats, Rat Rodent Repellent Pest Insect Control","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ESEOLP4kL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Plant Formula: The mouse repellent is made of pure natural plant formula, mainly made from mint, camphor, lemon and ginger. The fusion of these four raw materials has a strong smell, which will not cause harm to humans and pets, but rodent repellent pills will make rodents such as mice feel sick and achieve the effect of expelling them. Easy to Place: The method of using the rat repellent is very simple, you only need to take the rat repellent pill out of the package and put peppermint oil to repel mice and rats in a net bag, hang mouse repellent or place mouse repellent wherever you need to repel mice or pests. According to the size of the storage space, you can adjust the amount of peppermint oil. Repel Mice and Pests: Our mice repellent are mainly used to repel rodents, especially for mice, peppermint oil to repel mice and rats can repel house mice, yellow-breasted rats and brown rats. In addition, this mice repellent pills can also be used to remove cockroaches, spiders and other pests. Efficient and Long-lasting: Our rodent repellent pills are very effective. Rats or pests will stay away from your life as long as they smell the peppermint oil to repel mice and rats. And the fragrance of squirrel repellent is long-lasting and can last up to 12 weeks. You don’t need to replace mouse repellent at any time. Applicable to Many Occasions: The squirrel repellent is suitable for a variety of scenes, and mice repellent pills can exert its remarkable repelling effect indoors and outdoors. Rodent repellent pills can be used in indoor bedrooms, kitchens, hotels, restaurants, offices, warehouses, plumbing and other places.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ESEOLP4kL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Wanqueen","source_asin":"B0BWMWMDF7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-681197","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BWMWMDF7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BWMWMDF7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
