window.products.push({"id":681271,"name":"Comfort Zone CZFP1BK 600/1,200-Watt Mini Fireplace Heater with Realistic 3D Flame, Stay-Cool Body, Carry Handle, Overheat Sensor, and Safety Tip-Over ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71osTMGCI0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Powerful Heat Generation With 1200 Watts of power and two heat settings, this Comfort Zone Mini Fireplace Heater generates a significant amount of heat considering its compact size. The low heat setting provides a steady, warming airflow to any room, making it ideal for cold bedrooms or chilly home offices. Alternatively, the high setting provides a powerful current of warm air, helping to increase and maintain the temperature of larger rooms with ease. Loaded with Safety Features Featuring an overheat protection sensor with an automatic shut-off in the event of overheating, this tabletop heater is safe for indoor use in residential homes. For added safety, the built-in tip-over switch shuts off the power if the unit is accidentally knocked over. Realistic Fire and Ember Effects This tabletop electric heater is equipped with a realistic 3D flame effect and a bed of embers that provide a peaceful, intimate ambience to complement any home decor. The flame effect can also be used without the heat setting, providing a relaxing glow on nights where added heat is unnecessary. Versatile Design With a sleek metallic finish and a body that stays cool to the touch, you can easily move this desktop fireplace heater from room to room throughout the day. Use it on your desk while you work in your home office on cold winter days then put it beside your bed to combat the sub-zero temperatures on chilly winter nights. Equipped with a molded handle on top, you can easily carry the heater from one room to another, depending on where you need it. Practical and Efficient Beyond provide warmth and a peaceful glow for you and your family on cold winter days, this mini fireplace heater can also be used to apply direct heat in crucial areas of your home. For example, you can aim it directly at your pipes to prevent your plumbing from freezing in sub-zero temperatures.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71osTMGCI0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Comfort Zone","source_asin":"B0C6QLFY2D","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-681271","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C6QLFY2D","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C6QLFY2D","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
