window.products.push({"id":681386,"name":"Ivellow Cooling Blankets for Hot Sleepers, Summer Cooling Comforter Blanket Queen Absorb Heat to Keep Cool Lightweight Breathable Cold Blankets Double","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":56.74,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71HeoWoLKzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Cooling Blankets for Hot Sleepers】Ivellow cooling blanket is made of upgraded cooling technology fibers, instantly cools you down and stays cool-to-the-touch all night. The cooling comforter can brilliantly absorb and release body heat, and reduce skin temperature by 2-5°C instantly, provides excellent cooling comfort and makes you feel fresh without perspiration even during the hottest summer nights, great cool bedding for hot sleepers, night sweat and hot flashes. Enjoy cool and deep sleep! 【Luxuriously Soft & Double Side Cooling】Both sides of this cooling summer blanket is made of upgraded cooling technology fibers, silky soft and comfort to the touch, with a cool-sensing value (Q-max) of More Than 0.45, which provide strong cooling sensation than other blankets, agreeable for sensitive skin, adults or your pets. This summer comforter will help you fall asleep faster and stay asleep longer, keeping you cool fresh and comfortable in summer! 【Breathable Lightweight Cooling Comforter】Our cooling summer quilt is filled with 100% dacron fiber to form a 3-D hollow structure with high elasticity and compression, which works well in adjusting the humidity and temperature, ensures the cool comforter has very good breathability, The cool innovation technology of the cooling quilt can quickly transfer moisture, keep your skin dry and comfortable, the just right weight reduce your stress and help you relax and fall asleep quickly. 【Multi Usage Scenarios】This cool blanket for sleeping measures 79”x91”, just right to fit a full/queen bed. You can use this cooling throw blanket at home, at work or in the car. Get cozy with this cold comforter on the couch, sofa, bed, train, airplane, office nap, travel, cinema, park, beach, camping etc... Perfect for indoors, outdoors, and anywhere you want a extra soft comfy blanket to keep cool and snuggle with, comfy for all season use. 【Easy Care & Gift Package】Our cooling summer blankets is easy to maintain, it’s hand & machine washable, Laundry bag is highly recommended, prevent entanglement snagging and scratching. Mild Washing < 30℃, Do not bleach, Do not iron, Do not dry clean, Hang in the shade, no tumble dry. No pilling, no shrink, easy to keep your blanket clean and fresh. Our cool blanket is beautifully packaged and easy to carry, perfect to enjoy the cool summer anytime, the perfect summer gift for a loved one.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71HeoWoLKzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ivellow","source_asin":"B0C4F1ZHRZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-681386","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C4F1ZHRZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C4F1ZHRZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
