window.products.push({"id":681565,"name":"HANCIRCLE LED Coaster Colorful,12 Pack Light Up Coasters,LED Sticker Lights,Wine Bottle Lights,for Drinks,Bar Accessories,Party,Wedding","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.9,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/613znE6KJmL._AC_SL1248_.jpg","description":"LED Coaster Suitable for various scenarios: such as bar, party, wedding, dinner decoration.Coasters can be stuck to the bottom of drinks or wine glasses to set off the atmosphere. The colorful coaster (one coaster) has 7 kinds of light-emitting colors, press the switch button on the back, the first seven times are (red-green-blue-yellow-cyan-pink-white) always on, the 8th time is (red-green- blue-yellow-green-pink-white-colorful changes). Usage of bottle lights: open the package, unplug the insulation sheet (transparent plastic sheet) under the battery, and press the switch on the back to light up. There is a switch button on the back of the led coasters. Press the switch button to switch modes. The led light sticker has an authorized 3m adhesive layer, which can be firmly pasted on the bottom of the wine bottle and can be reused for 2-3 times; 4 high-brightness led lights make the transparent container bright; the led coaster can be bright for more than 12 hours. With a diameter of 2.362 inches and a thickness of 0.118 inches, the wine bottle lights are suitable for most wine bottles and wine glasses; the ultra-thin size of the bottle lights does not affect the normal use of containers such as wine bottles and wine glasses. The product includes: a box of 12 LED coasters, 8 spare CR1220 batteries (for coaster replacement batteries), 2 CR1220 batteries installed on each coaster. Tip: If the coaster lights do not come on, try to check if the insulation has been removed or adjust the position of the battery or contact us to confirm the problem. You can replace the battery by yourself.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/613znE6KJmL._AC_SL1248_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HANCIRCLE","source_asin":"B0B6BJLZQ3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-681565","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B6BJLZQ3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B6BJLZQ3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":681566,"name":"Plastic 1-Tier Microwave Steamer Heating Steamer, Vegetable Steamer for Cooking with Lid and Tray","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51jP+Mlj8UL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"MATERIAL: Made from high-quality plastic that is durable. Steam your veggies quickly and easily without having to buy and throw steam bags. DETAILS: This cooking pot set includes a transparent cover, 1 steamer, and a chassis. The lids have easy-locking clips and steam vents to prevent splatter, and the transparent cover allows you to watch your food cook. USAGE: Perfect for steaming vegetables, fruit, meat, seafood, desserts and more.It makes it easy and convenient to steam food quickly and healthily. SUITABLE FOR: Perfect time saving tool for college students, busy parents, and anyone looking for a quick meal on the go. INSTRUCTIONS: 1. Pour half a cup of water into the chassis. 2. place the steamer on the chassis. 3. open the vent on the transparent cover. Size: Diameter 8.4 inch, height 4.6 inch.Heat-resisting Range -4 °F to 40.5 °F.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51jP+Mlj8UL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SCWBOEII","source_asin":"B0B4ZJDJ8R","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-681566","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B4ZJDJ8R","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B4ZJDJ8R","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
