window.products.push({"id":681646,"name":"Geniospin Queen Comforter Set, Bed in a Bag Sage Green 7-Pieces, Botanical Pattern, All Season Comfortable Seersucker Bedding with Comforter, Sheets, ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":75.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91LUiMaeQoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Soft and Comfy : This queen comforter set features a year-round microfiber fabric construction for comfortable use. The hypoallergenic filling in the comforter, being made of ultra fine fibers. It is soft and lightweight, the cloud-like soft bedding set keeps you cozy and warm sleep through every night for all seasons. 3D Botanical Design: Unique Chic Seersucker comforter, elegant 3D Botanical vine design, featured in sage green, coming with matching shams, sheets and pillowcases. Vibrant farmhouse style which perfectly blends fashion and abstract art,adds an extra layer of art style to match your room décor and brighten your bedroom. Components & Size: Complete bed in a bag with great deal! Our queen size comforter set includes 7 pieces(inch): 1 Seersucker comforter 90x90, 1 flat sheet 90x102+4, 1 fitted sheet 60x80+14, 2 shams 20x26, 2 pillow cases 20x30+4. Fitted sheet with 14\" deep pocket design ensures a snug fit on your mattress . Delicate workmanship: This queen comforter is crafted by fine workmanship. Whole-piece microfiber fill in the comforter provides exceptional warmth and cozy. Firm quilting, no shifting after washing, soft and breathable. Since the comforter is packaged in a vacuum bag, it is highly recommended to expose it in the sun and tap gently for fluffy. Care & Services: Machine wash cold separately, gentle cycle, tumble dry low, do not bleach or iron. We provide bedding comforter sets free return and exchange service, don't hesitate to contact us if you have any questions, please rest assured to buy.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91LUiMaeQoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Geniospin","source_asin":"B0BLXD1T8C","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-681646","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BLXD1T8C","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BLXD1T8C","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
