window.products.push({"id":681672,"name":"Irene House Tall Man Power Lift Chair Lay Flat Heat Massage Dual Motor Recliners for Elderly Electric Chairs,Extened Footrest(Chenille Beige)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":999.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Te8rigukL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【LARGE SIZE】To suit a different demographic, the model 9188 has been redesigned with a wider seat and an extended footrest for larger people. The remotes could be used on either side as there are two loops on both sides where the remote could hang.2 Side pockets design creates a very convenient place for you to put remotes and other small belongings. 【DUAL OKIN MOTOR】This lift chair is different from original one, it's powered by OKIN 2.0 dual motor, each motor is independent. You can get any position you want easily as the backrest and footrest can be adjustable individually. The entire chair could be lifted up to help seniors to stand up easily, it’s also ideal for people who have leg/back problems or people who after surgery.NOTICE:This recliner comes with a power supply not battery back up. 【HUMANISTIC DESIGN WITH HEAT & MASSAGE】The stand up recliner chair designed with 4 vibrating massage nodes for back,lumbar, and one heating system for lumbar. All the features can be easily controlled by the remote controller. Comes with a lumbar pillow, which can support the waist, and widened backrest provide extra support for the body, more comfortable. 【COMFORTABLE UPHOLSTERY &STURDY CONSTRUCTION】High quality metal frame and padded high density sponge ensure long-term service, so that the lift chair is strong enough to withstand the weight of 300 lbs. Soft and gentle, the chenille feels like a warm hug from an old friend. It'll create a relaxing place that you never want to leave. 【CUSTOMER SERVICE & WARRANTY】Simply contact us via Email for any concerns during product installation and use. Warranty: Electronic components (motor/transformer/remote controller): 1+1 years; Cover (fabric, PU/PVC leather, top grain, etc): 3 years; Reclining mechanism: 3 years; Solid wood frame: 3 years. NOTICE: Returns for non-quality issues - the chair is recommended to be packed in original boxes and returned within 7 days, and the buyer pays for shipping costs.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Te8rigukL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Irene House","source_asin":"B0C7C2R5W7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-681672","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C7C2R5W7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C7C2R5W7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
