window.products.push({"id":681769,"name":"Bedsure Heated Mattress Pad King Size - Dual Control Electric Mattress Pad Bed Warmer and 4 Heat Settings, Coral Fleece with10 hr Timer Auto Shut Off ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":77.36,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81-Nb6sjqsL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Polyester Warmer Sleep: This unique mattress pad heats up quickly, allowing you to sleep warmer in winter, which helps to \"open up\" sore muscles and joints to relax them. Our heated mattress pad has deep pockets up to 18 inches, fitting most mattresses. Safety Promise: Using PTC/NTC heating wire provides the perfect temperature for restful sleep and healing restoration while offering the safety promise of overheating protection. Rest easy without worry of overheating, thanks to our bed warmer. Wrap yourself in a warm cloud, and enjoy peaceful sleep all winter long. Soft Fabric: Features coral fleece fabric, which is good at trapping heat and keeping you warm overnight. Soft-touch hugs you like a cloud. Preheat the mattress pad to your desired temperature preference so when you hop in bed you don't need to wait for warmth; it's already surrounding you. Dual Controllers: Our electric mattress pad king has four heating levels and an auto shut-off system (10 hours). Features dual control, so you and your partner can choose your own warmth levels. The cord between the controller and coupler is lengthened by 19 inches (overall length of 118 inches) and the length of the power cord is about 70 inches. Reliable Choice: Safe and reliable, our heated mattress pad complies with UL964 standards, providing a protection mechanism while keeping you warm. We ensure that our bed heater meets quality, health, and safety standards. Using our electric mattress pad while turning off your thermostat can save 76% a year on your heating bill. All of Bedsure's electric mattress pads sold in the US work at 120V.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81-Nb6sjqsL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BEDSURE","source_asin":"B091CQ349L","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-681769","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B091CQ349L","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B091CQ349L","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
