window.products.push({"id":681790,"name":"HAOCOO Blue Marble Memory Foam Bath Mat 16x24 inch Non Slip Modern Abstract Bathroom Rugs Soft Velvet Bath Rug Machine Washable Chic Style Door Carpet","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/717F6-vFgvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"VELVET SURFACE & FOAM PADDING-This Modern Marble Bath Mat is consisted of three layers. The surface is made of super soft and cozy coral velvet, pattern is vivid and pretty, never fade. Filled with breathable and comfortable foam in middle layer, providing a warm spa-like experience under your feet. TPR rubber backing ensures a safe using. ANTI-SLIP TPR BACKING-Made of 100% environmental TPR latex backing, The foam bath rug has a better grip to protect you from slipping after stepping on the mat. It is more durable and will not peel off or fall apart after multiple washes. Guarantee a long service life. Please make sure the floor are dry underneath the rug to prevent the rug from slipping. QUICK DEYING & ABSORBENCY-The bathroom mat with soft velvet microfiber layer which has a great absorbency of water and will dry up within a very short time to prevent the building up of moisture in the bathroom. With this thick bathroom rug, never worry about excess water on the floor. please make sure the floor. EASY CARE-The foam rug allows machine wash separately in cold water with mild detergent. Do not use chlorine or bleach. Tumble dry on low heat or lay to air dry. Color will not fade, stay vibrant and backing stay good after multiple washes. MULTI PURPOSE USE- HAOCOO Blue and Gold Marble bathroom rug has been designed in two sizes and two color options that ensure to match your bathroom decor. It also can be used at tub-side, front of the sink, house entryway, kitchen and bedroom. Romantic beautiful pattern design will surely complement your bathroom and help to bring some elegance to your house.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/717F6-vFgvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HAOCOO","source_asin":"B07ZVG2DZX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-681790","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07ZVG2DZX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07ZVG2DZX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
