window.products.push({"id":681838,"name":"AA Art Glass Morning Dew Aroma Essential Oil Diffuser Aromatherapy Humidifier 120ml Housing with 14-Color LED Light","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81z21wsWHIL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"If you encounter problems, please contact us first, we are willing to provide you with 2 years of service, we hope to get your four - five star evaluation. Description The diffusers begin with the Artist’s design, and are manufactured using proprietary mosaic glass technology. The Diffusing Mister creates ultrasonic vibrations to transform your essential oils and water into a health creating, fragrant addition to your room. Function Switches On / Off Switch - Press to activate mister. Press again to shut the mister off. Light Switch:  01st press - Rotating lights; 02nd press - Fix color;  03rd press - Half Red;04th press - Full Red;  05th press - Half Yellow;06th press - Full Yellow; 07th press - Half Purple;08th press - Full Purple; 09th press - Half Green; 10th press - Full Green; 11th press - Half Cyan; 12th press - Full Cyan; 13th press - Half Blue;14th press - Full Blue; 15th press - Half White; 16th press - Full White; 17th press - Light off. About this item You may prefer this new style of Aromatherapy machine to the conventional products which lack the aesthetic appeal of our 120 ml Ultrasonic Diffuser units Applying our adapted Ultrasonic technology, this diffuser is extremely quiet when in use, and has an automatic shutoff when the water is low The item is portable for anywhere there is a compatible outlet; Gym, Yoga, Spa, Nursery, Office, Bedrooms or Living Areas. It is the perfect gift for friends and family who love Aromatherapy or have issues which Essential Oil Aromatherapy can help to heal The mosaic glass Aromatherapy Essential Oil Diffuser is not only an aid to health, but also an object of art you will be proud to display in your home, office, or anyplace you may travel","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81z21wsWHIL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"AromAngel","source_asin":"B07542P881","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-681838","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07542P881","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07542P881","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
