window.products.push({"id":681984,"name":"Exclusivo Mezcla Christmas Comforter Set King Size, Reversible White and Rust Red Down Alternative Comforter Sets, Printed with Christmas Reindeer Wre","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/817jCQvlrxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"CLASSIC XMAS DESIGN: Inspired by Christmas heritage motifs, this fluffy comforter set would remind you of all warm memories of this special holiday. The front side features hand-painted imagery of the holiday season, like reindeer, bird, Christmas trees, wreath and \"Merry Christmas\" message. The reversible side is solid rust red print. Ideal down alternative comforter to spread holiday cheer this year! SOFT CHRISTMAS BEDDING: Made of 100% premium microfiber, with plush and fluffy fillings, our christmas bedding comforter is ultra soft and comfortable to the touch, suitable for all seasons, especially winter. As snowfall lightly covers every scene outside, it warmly embraces your whole body and gives you true wrapped-in-a-cloud feeling in Christmas Eve. The baffle box construction helps keep the down alternative fillings from shifting or clumping. DEMENSIONS: There are three sizes available to choose. Twin size: 1 comforter (66\"x90\")+ 1 pillow sham (20\"x26\"); Queen size: 1 comforter (90\"x90\")+ 2 pillow shams (20\"x26\"); King size: 1 comforter (90\"x104\")+ 2 pillow shams (20\"x36\"). If you want a comforter that drapes to the floor as the picture, please measure the height of mattress and bed frame in advance to choose a appropriate one. MULTIPLEUSE COVERLET: Get ready for this Jolly Holiday Season? Let this fluffy comforter set be your favorite bedding set, delightful home decor and ideal X-max gift pick! Rich array of colors and pattern will infuse warmth and vitality into your home, perfect for Christmas party or family reunion. It is also a heartfelt and delicate Christmas gift to express your love and care to your families or friends. EASY TO CARE: Machine wash cold on gentle cycle, tumble dry low. Do not bleach and iron. No shifting, clumping, fading or shedding after wash. After taking the comforter out from the compact package, please shake and pat it gently, and wait a few hours to make it back original state. Wash it before the first use to get a more comfortable using experience.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/817jCQvlrxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Exclusivo Mezcla","source_asin":"B0BHS6DLQD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-681984","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BHS6DLQD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BHS6DLQD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
